//@version=6
// PROVENANCE: written 2026-11-15 (inv-fmt-1115). NEVER COMPILED ON TRADINGVIEW.
// Does TradingView accept a NON-LITERAL calc_bars_count (an input, as luxy's `adaptiveWarmup`)?
// If it compiles: capture at the default (100) and once with the input set to 50.
// CAPTURE: NYSE:RDDT 1D from the listing (666 bars). Also record the compile error text if any.
N = input.int(100, "bars")
indicator("UCTPROBE_VW_CBC_INPUT_COUNT", overlay = false, calc_bars_count = N)
var int n = 0
n += 1
plot(bar_index, "A00_bar_index")
plot(n, "A01_var_count")
